{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, add a focused stale-request guard, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I’ll add a request counter that advances on every search, including empty input, and guard results, errors, and loading updates. The existing tests cover normal behavior; I’ll also check overlapping requests without adding or modifying test files.\n\nUpdated src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests. Inline checks passed 8 stale-request scenarios. git diff --check passed. Verification command exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Updated src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests. Inline checks passed 8 stale-request scenarios. git diff --check passed. Verification command exited 0.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":13,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/1-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":201,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-105c978cc3dd6fa5d6b4f82243879317.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: '1', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const scenario of ['pending', 'completed', 'cleared', 'same-query']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const older = c.search('old');\n    const newer = scenario === 'cleared' ? c.search('  ') : c.search(scenario === 'same-query' ? 'old' : 'new');\n    if (scenario === 'completed') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items);\n      await newer;\n    }\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    let emissions = 0;\n    const unsubscribe = c.subscribe(() => emissions++);\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? items : new Error('Stale error'));\n    await older;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    assert.equal(emissions, 1, 'stale completion must not emit state');\n    unsubscribe();\n    if (scenario === 'pending' || scenario === 'same-query') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items);\n      await newer;\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, items);\n      assert.equal(c.getState().loading, false);\n    }\n    if (scenario === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('PASS: 8 stale success/failure scenarios, including clear and repeated queries');\nNODE\n git diff --check; git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-jm2sn40h/1-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":681,"stdout_bytes":599,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-99f66f6caf2e2a17dc20e8703bbfb903.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":50765,"output_tokens":1151}}
